+# Operationalization checklist — finish Aegis production hardening
+
+Overview: follow these steps in order. Each step references scripts/manifests under ops/.
+
+1) Build & publish pinned detector image (CI)
+ - Ensure ARTIFACT_BASE contains pinned model artifacts and checksums.
+ - Set DETECTOR_IMAGE and COSIGN_KMS_URI in GitHub Secrets.
+ - Trigger .github/workflows/build_and_verify_detectors.yml (created earlier).
+ - Verify image imports:
+   docker run --rm $DETECTOR_IMAGE python3 -c "import nudenet,presidio_analyzer,whisper,pytesseract; print('ok')"
+
+2) Deploy detector runtime (Kubernetes)
+ - Apply ops/serving/models/detector_deployment.yaml to deploy detector pods on nodes.
+ - Verify pods READY and model files exist under /opt/aegis/models.
+
+3) Enforce network controls and canonical gateway path
+ - Apply ops/infra/k8s/networkpolicy-enforce-gateway.yaml to block direct access to Triton/vLLM services from outside gateway namespace.
+ - Run ops/automation/deployment_coverage_check.py and remediate any flagged deployments.
+
+4) Calibration & thresholds
+ - Sample representative traffic, create ops/fl/calibration/candidates.txt.
+ - Run labeling: python3 ops/fl/calibration/label_tool.py --input candidates.txt --out ops/fl/calibration/labeled.csv
+ - Run calibration pipeline: ./ops/fl/calibration/run_calibration_pipeline.sh
+ - Validate thresholds on holdout and publish to ARTIFACT_BASE; ensure /opt/aegis/models/thresholds.json updated.
+
+5) Harden DP & auth
+ - Edit ops/infra/terraform/dp_ha/terraform.tfvars with VPC/subnet values and run terraform plan/apply (requires CloudSec review).
+ - Apply Kubernetes manifests: ops/infra/k8s/dp_deployment_mtls.yaml and verify ExternalSecret pulls DB URL & DP_AUTH_TOKEN.
+ - Provision KMS key and configure cosign + approver KMS policies (ops/infra/terraform/kms_cosign_iam/*).
+ - Enable mTLS on DP (cert-manager) using ops/infra/k8s/certmanager-issuer.yaml and ops/infra/k8s/dp_service_mtls.yaml.
+ - Configure gateway to enforce DP charging fail‑closed (ops/serving/gateway/gateway_dp_enforcer.py); set ENABLE_DP_FAIL_CLOSED=true.
+
+6) Adversarial automation & remediation
+ - Enable redteam_full GitHub Action (.github/workflows/redteam_full.yml).
+ - Enable auto-remediation action ops/automation/redteam_autoremediate.yml (creates tickets, calls content-alert-handler, triggers Argo remediation, creates retrain job).
+ - Validate Argo remediation workflow (ops/automation/argo/content_remediation_improvements.yaml) in staging.
+
+7) Approver signing & audit
+ - Deploy approver signing mediator (OIDC) using ops/human_review/signing_service/k8s/signing_service_oidc.yaml.
+ - Ensure approver OIDC roles/scopes and KMS COSIGN_KMS_URI assigned and limited via IAM policy.
+ - Run a signing end‑to‑end test: POST payload → /sign and verify cosign verify-blob of returned signature.
+
+8) Run an incident drill
+ - Run ops/runbooks/incident_drill/run_incident_drill.sh and validate: Argo workflow run, model disabled (scaled to 0), evidence uploaded to audit S3, Rekor/cosign proofs present.
+
+9) Monitoring & SLO tuning
+ - Collect 7–14 days of metrics (ops/monitoring/baseline_metrics.md).
+ - Tune ops/monitoring/safety_alert_config.yaml thresholds, create dashboards, and update runbooks.
+
+Notes & required approvals:
+ - All infra Terraform must be submitted for CloudSec review before apply.
+ - Do not run terraform apply until infra/jurisdiction approval and secret management (Vault/ExternalSecrets) are in place.
+
