+# Containment playbook (high severity content incident)
+
+1) Acknowledge alert (PagerDuty/Slack)
+2) Immediately trigger remediation (if not already running):
+   curl -X POST $CONTENT_ALERT_HANDLER_URL -d '{"alert":"manual_trigger","reason":"containment"}'
+3) Verify Argo remediation workflow started (argo list -n aegis-ml)
+4) Verify model deployment scaled to 0:
+   kubectl -n aegis-ml get deployment model-serving -o yaml | yq '.spec.replicas'
+5) Download evidence bundle from audit S3 and verify cosign signature:
+   aws s3 cp s3://<bucket>/content_incident/<bundle> .
+   cosign verify --key $COSIGN_KMS_URI <bundle>
+6) Triage & RCA: ML + Data + Security + Legal stakeholders review evidence.
+7) Schedule retrain (if needed) and staged redeploy after negative examples added.
+
